  "notes": "{浮|う}く is an intransitive verb meaning to float or rise up.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {浮|う}かべる (transitive, to set afloat)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {浮|う}いている means 'is floating' (ongoing state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {水|みず}に{浮|う}く: to float on water\n- {浮|う}いた{話|はなし}: idle talk, rumors\n- {浮|う}き{沈|しず}み: ups and downs\n\nRELATED:\n- {浮|う}かぶ: to float, to come to mind",
